{"id":"entity-46358977591869678499","name":"Policy definition","purpose":"The catalogue of Group Policy settings a person can browse and configure: each policy's name, explanation, registry location and the form it is edited through, with its translated texts.","membershipRule":"One policy definition catalogue item: a policy, category or supported-product entry from ADMX template files, its ADML translated strings and presentation layouts, and the folders, downloads and packages that supply those template files. Not the values a policy is set to, and not comments on a policy.","evidence":[{"file":"PolicyPlus/AdmxFile.vb","firstLine":18,"lastLine":20},{"file":"PolicyPlus/AdmlFile.vb","firstLine":16,"lastLine":36}]}
{"id":"entity-54216265301484356956","name":"Policy setting","purpose":"The state a policy is configured to (enabled, disabled, or a chosen value) as stored in a policy source: the registry, a policy file (POL), a REG file or a user's registry hive, with the Group Policy version stamp kept beside it.","membershipRule":"One configured policy value or policy-source container: a registry key, value name, data and value kind under the policy keys of a local or mounted registry, a Registry.pol / POL / REG file holding them, a user's NTUSER.DAT hive, and the gpt.ini that versions the Group Policy object. Not the catalogue describing the policy, and not comments.","evidence":[{"file":"PolicyPlus/PolicySource.vb","firstLine":360,"lastLine":405},{"file":"PolicyPlus/PolicyLoader.vb","firstLine":20,"lastLine":100}]}
{"id":"entity-01494854910295739228","name":"Policy comment","purpose":"A free-text note an administrator attaches to a policy, kept in a comment file beside the policy definitions.","membershipRule":"One comment text attached to one policy ID, in a CMTX comment file and the folder holding it. Not the policy definition or its value.","evidence":[{"file":"PolicyPlus/CmtxFile.vb","firstLine":5,"lastLine":13},{"file":"PolicyPlus/Main.vb","firstLine":335,"lastLine":336}]}
{"id":"entity-15432428091703108209","name":"Program setting","purpose":"A preference of the Policy Plus application itself, remembered between runs in the current user's registry.","membershipRule":"One named user preference of the application kept under its own configuration registry key. Not policy values.","evidence":[{"file":"PolicyPlus/ConfigurationStorage.vb","firstLine":3,"lastLine":18}]}
{"id":"entity-63009817546631803878","name":"Windows user account","purpose":"A person's Windows account (name, security identifier and profile folder) whose policies or registry hive are chosen for editing.","membershipRule":"One local or domain user account: its name, SID, and profile folder under C:\\Users used to find its hive or its policy object. Not the policy values themselves.","evidence":[{"file":"PolicyPlus/OpenUserGpo.vb","firstLine":5,"lastLine":12},{"file":"PolicyPlus/OpenUserRegistry.vb","firstLine":5,"lastLine":17}]}
